Welcome to Dark Pawns MUD.

   Type 'credits' to see who built this world.
   Type 'info' for the world background and setting.
   Type 'help' for the command and help system.
   Type 'help newbie' if you're new here.
   Type 'news' for the latest updates.
   Type 'policies' for the rules of the realm.

   Rules of the Realm:
   1. No harassment, sexism, racism, or bigotry of any kind.
   2. Player killing is allowed for characters over level 10.
   3. Do not exploit bugs — report them to an immortal.
   4. Have fun, explore, and make friends.

   Enjoy your stay!
